msgid "Creates an item of a custom content type you have allowlisted. It stays a draft unless the agent holds that type's publish capability, and force-draft still applies."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:100
msgid "Updates an item of an allowlisted custom content type by id. Publishing needs that type's own publish capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:101
msgid "Writes one allowlisted scalar meta value to a post the agent can edit. Only allowlisted keys."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:102
msgid "Writes one allowlisted scalar user meta value to a user the agent can edit. Auth, capability, and 2FA keys are blocked outright."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:103
msgid "Sets a post's featured image to an existing attachment id. It does not upload anything."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:104
msgid "Uploads an image from base64 data (jpg, png, gif, webp; SVG is rejected) and adds it to the media library."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:105
msgid "Updates an attachment's title, alt text, caption, or description. Requires edit access to that attachment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:106
msgid "Approves, unapproves, spams, or trashes a comment. Requires the moderate_comments capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:107
msgid "Adds a comment to a post as the agent user. It is held for moderation, never auto-published, and the author is always the agent, not free-form input. Requires the moderate_comments capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:108
msgid "Edits a comment's text only. It cannot change the post, author, email, or IP. Requires edit access to that comment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:109
msgid "Creates a term in a public taxonomy. Requires the manage_categories capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:110
msgid "Updates a term. Reparenting is guarded against hierarchy loops."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:111
msgid "Adds terms to a post without removing its existing terms. Requires edit access to the post and the taxonomy's assign capability; only existing terms in that taxonomy can be added."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:112
msgid "Writes one allowlisted scalar meta value to a term you can edit. Only allowlisted keys; protected keys are blocked."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:113
msgid "Restores a post to one of its revisions. The current state is saved as a fresh revision first, so the change is reversible."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:114
msgid "Edits a user's display name, name, or email. Changing a role needs the promote-users capability and never demotes the last administrator. Requires edit access to that user."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:115
msgid "Creates a reusable block. Its markup is sanitized, and the author is always the agent. Requires the edit-posts capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:116
msgid "Updates a reusable block's title or markup by id. The markup is sanitized. Requires edit access to that block."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:117
msgid "Creates a navigation menu. Requires the edit-theme-options capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:119
msgid "Adds an item (link) to a navigation menu. The URL is sanitized. Requires the edit-theme-options capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:122
msgid "Writes a post's Yoast SEO fields to its post meta. URL fields are sanitized as URLs, and the robots directives are checked against what Yoast accepts before they are saved. Requires edit access to that post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:123
msgid "Writes a post's Rank Math SEO fields to its post meta. URL fields are sanitized as URLs, and robots is stored in the directive-array form Rank Math expects. Requires edit access to that post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:124
msgid "Writes a post's structured-data schema of a given type to Rank Math. The whole object is sanitized, top to bottom. Requires edit access to that post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:125
msgid "Writes a post's SEO fields through All in One SEO's own data store, not post meta. URL fields are sanitized as URLs. Requires edit access to that post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:126
msgid "Writes ACF field values on a post by field key. Each value is sanitized for its field type before it is saved. Requires edit access to that post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:127
msgid "Writes ACF field values on a term by field key. Each value is sanitized for its field type. Requires edit access to that term."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:128
msgid "Writes ACF field values on a user by field key, each value sanitized for its field type. It only writes ACF fields, never the account's role or login. Requires edit access to that user."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:129
msgid "Creates a WooCommerce product from a name, plus optional type, status, description, prices, SKU, stock, categories, tags, images, and attributes. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:133
msgid "Creates a global WooCommerce product attribute taxonomy from a name, plus optional slug, type, sort order, and public-archives flag. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:134
msgid "Updates a global product attribute taxonomy by id, changing only the fields you send. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:136
msgid "Creates a refund on a WooCommerce order by order id. Accepts an amount, optional reason, and optional line-item breakdown. The refund reason is returned verbatim and may contain customer-entered text; it is returned under the Integrations security disclaimer. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:139
msgid "Moves a post the agent can edit to the Trash, where you can restore it. Never a permanent delete."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:140
msgid "Moves a page to the Trash, where you can restore it. Never a permanent delete."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:141
msgid "Removes an allowlisted meta key and all its values from a post the agent can edit. Only allowlisted keys."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:145
msgid "Permanently removes one revision from a post's history. The live post is unchanged, but the deleted revision cannot be recovered. Requires edit access to the parent post."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:146
msgid "Permanently deletes an attachment: the file and its library entry are removed and cannot be recovered. Requires delete access to that attachment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:147
msgid "Removes an allowlisted meta key and all its values from a term you can edit. This cannot be undone. Only allowlisted keys."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:148
msgid "Permanently deletes a comment. This bypasses the Trash and cannot be undone - use moderate-comment to trash a comment recoverably instead. Requires edit access to that comment."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:149
msgid "Creates a new user with the site default role only (never an admin or a caller-chosen role). Requires the create-users capability. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:150
msgid "Permanently deletes a user and reassigns their content to another user. Never deletes you or the last administrator. Requires the delete-users capability. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:151
msgid "Removes an allowlisted user meta key from a user the agent can edit. This cannot be undone. Auth and capability keys can never be touched."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:152
msgid "Permanently deletes a post, bypassing the Trash. This cannot be undone - use trash-post to remove a post recoverably instead. Requires delete access to that post. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:153
msgid "Permanently deletes a page, bypassing the Trash. This cannot be undone - use trash-page to remove a page recoverably instead. Requires delete access to that page. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:154
msgid "Writes a small allowlist of site settings only (name, tagline, timezone, formats, posts per page). It can never change the site URL, admin email, default role, or open registration. Requires manage-options. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:155
msgid "Permanently deletes a navigation menu and all of its items. This cannot be undone - menus have no Trash. Requires the edit-theme-options capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:156
msgid "Permanently removes one item from a navigation menu. This cannot be undone. Requires the edit-theme-options capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:157
msgid "Permanently deletes a WooCommerce product, bypassing the Trash. This cannot be undone. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:158
msgid "Permanently deletes a product variation, bypassing the Trash. This cannot be undone. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability. Off by default."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:163
msgid "Lists WooCommerce shipping zones with their id, name, and order. The Rest of World zone (id 0) is always present. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:164
msgid "Reads one WooCommerce shipping zone by id, including its name, order, and configured zone locations. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:167
msgid "Lists the shipping methods configured in a WooCommerce shipping zone, by zone id. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:168
msgid "Reads one shipping method from a WooCommerce shipping zone by zone id and instance id, including its type, title, and enabled state. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:169
msgid "Adds a shipping method to a WooCommerce shipping zone. Provide the zone id and method type (such as flat_rate, free_shipping, or local_pickup). Returns the new method shape. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:173
msgid "Creates a WooCommerce tax rate from a rate value, with optional country, state, name, priority, compound flag, shipping flag, order, and class slug. Returns the full rate shape. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:177
msgid "Returns a sales summary (total sales, order count, net sales, average order value) for a date range you specify. Queries completed and processing orders only. Defaults to the current calendar month. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:178
msgid "Returns the top-selling products for a period (week, month, or year) ordered by quantity sold. Returns product id, name, and quantity only - no pricing data. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:179
msgid "Returns order counts broken down by WooCommerce status (pending, processing, on-hold, completed, cancelled, refunded, failed) and a grand total. Read-only. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:180
msgid "Returns product counts broken down by post status (publish, draft, private, pending, trash) and a total of non-trashed products. Read-only. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:181
msgid "Lists all registered WooCommerce payment gateways with id, title, and enabled state. Credential and secret settings are never returned. Read-only. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:182
msgid "Reads one payment gateway by id: title, description, enabled state, order, and non-secret settings. Fields whose names contain key, secret, token, password, api, or private are always stripped before the response is sent. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/disclosures.php:183
msgid "Updates a payment gateway by id, changing only the fields you send: enabled state, title, description, or display order. Credential and secret fields can never be written through this ability. Returns the updated gateway shape with secrets redacted. Requires the manage-WooCommerce capability."
msgstr ""

