msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings.php:542
msgid "Turn this on if you want to look over agent-created content before it goes live."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings.php:550
msgid "Strict block validation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings.php:552
msgid "Reject an agent write when its block markup would show as invalid content in the editor."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings.php:553
msgid "When this is off (the default), a write with questionable block markup still saves, and the agent is sent a warning so it can fix its next attempt. Turn it on to refuse the write instead, so nothing that could look broken in the editor is ever stored."
