#: includes/admin/settings.php:590
msgid "Permanently remove all plugin data when the plugin is deleted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/settings.php:591
msgid "When this is off (the default), your settings, activity log, and OAuth data are kept if you delete the plugin, so a reinstall picks up your configuration. Turn it on only if you want everything removed. This cannot be undone."
